<header class="mb-8">
  <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40">Money — <%= currentBusinessUnit %></p>
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl mt-1">Money</h1>
  <p class="text-ink/50 text-sm mt-1">The accounting equation at work: what the business owns, and how it's financed.</p>
</header>

<section class="mb-10">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40 mb-2">Assets</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-2xl tabular-nums <%= totalAssets >= 0 ? 'text-till' : 'text-clay' %>"><%= fmt(totalAssets) %></p>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-ink/5 space-y-1 text-xs text-ink/50">
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Cash Balance</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(cashBalance) %></span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Fixed Assets</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(fixedAssetsBalance) %></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40 mb-2">Equity</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-2xl tabular-nums"><%= fmt(totalEquity) %></p>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-ink/5 space-y-1 text-xs text-ink/50">
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Owner Capital</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(capitalBalance) %></span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Re-invested Funds</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(retainedEarnings) %></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40 mb-2">Liabilities</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-2xl tabular-nums text-clay"><%= fmt(totalLiabilities) %></p>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-ink/5 space-y-1 text-xs text-ink/50">
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Debts (Payables, Leases, Provisions)</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(otherLiabilitiesBalance) %></span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Loans Outstanding</span><span class="font-mono"><%= fmt(loanBalance) %></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-5">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40 mb-2">Net Worth (Assets − Liabilities = Equity)</p>
    <p class="font-mono text-2xl tabular-nums"><%= fmt(totalAssets - totalLiabilities) %></p>
    <p class="text-xs text-ink/40 mt-2">What the business owns (KES <%= fmt(totalAssets) %>) minus what it owes (KES <%= fmt(totalLiabilities) %>) = what belongs to the owner.</p>
    <% if (Math.abs((totalAssets - totalLiabilities) - totalEquity) > 0.01) { %>
      <p class="text-xs text-clay mt-1">⚠ The accounting equation is out of balance: Assets − Liabilities (KES <%= fmt(totalAssets - totalLiabilities) %>) ≠ Equity (KES <%= fmt(totalEquity) %>). Run diagnostics.</p>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40 mb-4">Go to</p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
    <a href="/money/funds" class="bg-till text-paper rounded-xl p-6 hover:brightness-110 transition flex flex-col justify-between h-32">
      <span class="font-display text-xl">Funds</span>
      <span class="text-paper/70 text-sm">Capital, loans, and unit income</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/money/investments" class="bg-white border border-ink/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-till transition flex flex-col justify-between h-32">
      <span class="font-display text-xl">Investments</span>
      <span class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Bonds, shares — buy and sell</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/money/cash-flow" class="bg-white border border-ink/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-till transition flex flex-col justify-between h-32">
      <span class="font-display text-xl">Cash Flow</span>
      <span class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Cash/mobile/bank, in vs out</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/transactions" class="bg-white border border-ink/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-till transition flex flex-col justify-between h-32">
      <span class="font-display text-xl">Transactions</span>
      <span class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Every posted journal entry</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/accounts" class="bg-white border border-ink/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-till transition flex flex-col justify-between h-32">
      <span class="font-display text-xl">Accounts</span>
      <span class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Chart of accounts</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
